  <item>
    <title>古早K-POP是如何完成文化入侵的？-聊聊我们那个时代的韩流</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d2ce3f0766616acdba65f5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d2ce3f0766616acdba65f5</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 Mar 2025 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期内容速览：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">00:51</a> 金赛纶离世；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> &nbsp;最初接触韩流：韩团、韩剧、韩娱；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 回顾kpop对我们的强势“文化输出”；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> blackpink+各自solo；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> kpop早期代表偶像；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3420">57:00</a> 权志龙的新歌；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4560">76:00</a> 崔雪莉的离去；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4680">78:00</a> 韩国综艺的影响；</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主持：托粒Tori、西歪CY</span></p>]]></description>
