  <item>
    <title>人生在世，谁没失恋过呢?</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/676414df1e823e72d32cd19b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">676414df1e823e72d32cd19b</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 20 Dec 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目速览：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="103">01:43</a> 想聊‘失恋’这个话题的契机；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="197">03:17</a> 以现在的眼光去看待当时的那些‘失恋’； &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 比较激烈的一次分手经历；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="876">14:36</a> 如何处理前任的现任的“关心”；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1152">19:12</a> 女孩子之间总会保全互相的“体面”；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1193">19:53</a> 消失的男朋友；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1346">22:26</a> 大家会去看前任或与前任有关系的人的社交媒体吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1519">25:19</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2193">36:33</a> 失恋了，怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 暗恋=失恋？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2498">41:38</a> 失恋对自己的影响；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2662">44:22</a> 痛苦无法避免就去享受？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> 接受专业的心理治疗和仰赖玄学哪个更有效？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> &nbsp;找到新鲜的爱好是比较有效疏解失恋带来的痛苦；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3470">57:50</a> 没有说“再见”的恋情；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4790">79:50</a> 人长久地活在痛苦中，会习惯痛苦甚至遗忘痛苦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主持：西歪CY、托粒Tori</span></p><span></span><p><span>马上圣诞节啦~我们在这里提前祝大家圣诞快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnGCzjz4FzNS22-95IuNI9XTinfs.m4a" length="104413191" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:26:15</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgde1RG4eC_MbBm1NcWm76GdUYHI.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
